        "language": "english",
        "review": "A spooky item game is a short and sweet indie horror game. I found that the gameplay was fun and that it reminded me of phasmaphobia. The game is designed in clever ways to make the game harder it makes the game a bit more strategic with the order that you do things. For instance there are times you will need to look at the creature on one side of the screen when you need to be looking at your emf reading or the pattern on your power on the other side of your screen. One of my only questions is if the game will get more updates. Its a short game that i think i would continue playing if there was more. More haunted items, and harder shifts for an example. The game was good and made me want more.",
